omi wearing a lab coat over an outfit of your choosing.\n\nFor the outfit, please include somewhere on her clothing a small pin of a teddy bear.\n\nI'd also like a difference in the artwork that includes a version of Kotomi wearing and not wearing eye-glasses, please.\n\nI would like to give you creative freedom for drawing the background, pose and expression however you like, so I hope that makes the request even more enjoyable for you!\n\nThank you very much!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@nekonekonenneko/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 57736, "client_id": 290176, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96deb916/requests/118621_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5855bc5b4de12c75f0e7e8335dd10b27", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/96deb916/requests/118621_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5855bc5b4de12c75f0e7e8335dd10b27, https://si.imgix.net/96deb916/requests/118621_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=715a024958b8eba91da88ccbf67a667b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/96deb916/requests/118621_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97759ace9230f5cc12fe26c684a83a2c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96deb916/requests/118621_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=555c125e152d6de26af51918bc93f4d0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/96deb916/requests/118621_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=555c125e152d6de26af51918bc93f4d0, https://si.imgix.net/96deb916/requests/118621_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=